    <Label IsHitTestVisible="false" Name="Title" Style="GalleryTitle" Text="The Falling Ladder" DecimalsToShow="2" X="13.121" Y="25.5" />
    <Label IsHitTestVisible="false" Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="A ladder leans against a wall with a bucket of\npaint hanging on it. The ladder slips: its top\nslides down the wall, its foot slides out\nalong the ground.\n\nWhat path does the bucket follow? Drag the top\nof the ladder down and see the curve.\n\nThen slide the bucket to the middle of the\nladder. Now what shape is the path?" DecimalsToShow="2" X="13.121" Y="22.156" />
